WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.402 size:84% position:42%
-Let´s get to the news.

00:00:02.402 --> 00:00:04.571 align:start size:94% position:6%
After Hillary Clinton
joked last night

00:00:04.571 --> 00:00:05.805 size:88% position:44%
that she was considering

00:00:05.805 --> 00:00:08.141 align:start size:94% position:6%
dressing up as president
for Halloween,

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:10.810 align:start size:94% position:6%
Donald Trump Jr. tweeted,
"That´s cute.

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:13.380 align:start size:94% position:6%
She can borrow
my Donald Trump mask."

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:15.448 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Huh.

00:00:15.448 --> 00:00:16.850 size:84% position:42%
That´s Donald Trump Jr.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:20.053 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just a chill, normal dude,
who owns --

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:22.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
who owns a mask
of his father´s face.

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:27.660 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:29.029 size:81% position:41%
"I love you, Don Jr.!"

00:00:29.029 --> 00:00:32.832 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:32.832 --> 00:00:34.100 size:88% position:44%
The White House released

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:36.136 align:start size:94% position:6%
the official portraits
of President Trump

00:00:36.136 --> 00:00:37.937 align:start size:94% position:6%
and Vice President
Mike Pence today.

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:40.907
And they put one of Steve Bannon
out on the front stoop.

00:00:40.907 --> 00:00:48.982
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:00:48.982 --> 00:00:52.318
In an interview yesterday,
White House Chief of Staff

00:00:52.318 --> 00:00:54.154
John Kelly said the Civil War

00:00:54.154 --> 00:00:57.424 align:start size:94% position:6%
was caused by a lack
of ability to compromise.

00:00:57.424 --> 00:00:59.659 align:start size:94% position:6%
Even weirder,
he said that Pearl Harbor

00:00:59.659 --> 00:01:01.961 align:start size:94% position:6%
was an air-traffic-control
issue.

00:01:01.961 --> 00:01:03.396 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.396 --> 00:01:06.099
I don´t know why we ever thought
there was a reasonable person

00:01:06.099 --> 00:01:08.301
working in Trump´s White House.

00:01:08.301 --> 00:01:10.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
That´s like going
into a Hot Topic

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:12.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
and asking to meet
their rocket scientist.

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:14.074 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:15.809 align:start size:94% position:6%
A White House official
confirmed today

00:01:15.809 --> 00:01:17.510 align:start size:94% position:6%
that President Trump
will not visit

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:19.012
the Korean demilitarized zone

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:20.713 align:start size:94% position:6%
during his upcoming trip
to Asia.

00:01:20.713 --> 00:01:22.849 align:start size:94% position:6%
In fact, to prevent
an international incident,

00:01:22.849 --> 00:01:25.452 align:start size:94% position:6%
Trump´s aides will
just take him to Panda Express

00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:27.053 size:84% position:42%
and tell him it´s Asia.

00:01:27.053 --> 00:01:30.390
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:33.760 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Their English...

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:35.628 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know,
I just got back from Asia,

00:01:35.628 --> 00:01:37.197
and their English is very good."

00:01:37.197 --> 00:01:39.899 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:42.268
"Also, do you know
they have an Asia at LaGuardia?"

00:01:42.268 --> 00:01:47.440 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.440 --> 00:01:48.808 size:88% position:44%
According to a new poll,

00:01:48.808 --> 00:01:51.611
Mitch McConnell is the nation´s
least popular Senator,

00:01:51.611 --> 00:01:55.215 align:start size:94% position:6%
which explains the festivities
over at Ted Cruz´s office.

00:01:55.215 --> 00:01:59.819
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:03.823
Engineers at Ford recently
created a robotic butt --

00:02:03.823 --> 00:02:07.393 align:start size:94% position:6%
a robotic butt --
designed to simulate

00:02:07.393 --> 00:02:10.730 align:start size:94% position:6%
the effect of sitting in
a car seat for over a decade.

00:02:10.730 --> 00:02:13.900 size:84% position:42%
Said designers, "Right.
That´s why we made it."

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:20.773 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.773 --> 00:02:22.876
"Who left the robot butt out?"

00:02:22.876 --> 00:02:24.310 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:26.846 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughing ]

00:02:26.846 --> 00:02:28.381
-Do you like that, Wally?

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:30.216 align:start size:94% position:6%
You´ve enjoyed
robot butt all day.

00:02:30.216 --> 00:02:33.720 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:36.556
There´s no time today that I´ve
told the robot butt joke

00:02:36.556 --> 00:02:38.024 align:start size:94% position:6%
that Wally
hasn´t laughed the loudest.

00:02:38.024 --> 00:02:42.095 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.095 --> 00:02:44.531
Today was Christopher Columbus´
birthday,

00:02:44.531 --> 00:02:45.999 align:start size:94% position:6%
and if you´re wondering
what to get him,

00:02:45.999 --> 00:02:49.235
how about something that already
belongs to someone else?

00:02:49.235 --> 00:02:51.471 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.471 --> 00:02:58.111 size:84% position:42%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:58.111 --> 00:03:01.014 align:start size:94% position:6%
Chipotle offered
$3 burritos today

00:03:01.014 --> 00:03:04.117
to any customers who ordered
in their Halloween costume.

00:03:04.117 --> 00:03:06.119 align:start size:94% position:6%
Good news
for the front of the horse,

00:03:06.119 --> 00:03:08.188
but terrible news for the back.

00:03:08.188 --> 00:03:10.657
[ Laughter and applause ]

